{"type":"text","timestamp":1787390197602,"sessionID":"ses_fd73fc0ffffeGHcMl0DsijAuqm","part":{"id":"prt_028c1f878001xhburUA0McCl0m","messageID":"msg_028c1e7e5001LR7GALu7WwIuwg","sessionID":"ses_fd73fc0ffffeGHcMl0DsijAuqm","type":"text","text":"No test runner is configured in this repo; my manual checks cover all the specified cases. The fix is complete.\n\nSummary of the change in `functions/diff.js`:\n- Compares from lower→higher version (order-independent).\n- Identical / build-metadata-only → `null`.\n- Main-version steps → `major`/`minor`/`patch`.\n- Into a prerelease → `'pre'` prefix (`premajor`/`preminor`/`prepatch`/`prerelease`).\n- Two prereleases of same main version → `'prerelease'`.\n- Out of a prerelease (same main version) → `major` if minor&patch are 0, `minor` if minor≠0 & patch=0, else `patch`.\n- Invalid versions still throw `TypeError` (parse still called with `throwErrors=true`).","time":{"start":1787390195833,"end":1787390197598}}}
